From: Package maintainers <packages@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] select privileged configuration from UAPI paths
Source: downstream
Upstream: not submitted; needs agreement on Unix vendor and transient paths

Keep caller-supplied daemon configuration paths and unprivileged XDG files
unchanged. For implicit privileged configuration, select the first complete
file from /etc/libvirt, /run/libvirt, or /usr/lib/libvirt. An existing empty
file remains selected and masks lower files.

--- a/src/libvirt_private.syms
+++ b/src/libvirt_private.syms
@@ -2215,6 +2215,7 @@
 virConfGetValueType;
 virConfGetValueUInt;
 virConfGetValueULLong;
+virConfFindSystemConfig;
 virConfLoadConfig;
 virConfNew;
 virConfReadFile;

--- a/src/util/virconf.h
+++ b/src/util/virconf.h
@@ -124,4 +124,5 @@
